<title>USA: United Tech up after upbeat analyst meeting.</title>
<headline>United Tech up after upbeat analyst meeting.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in United Technologies Corp rose four percent on Tuesday, amid of favorable analyst comments.</p>
<p>According to market sources, Morgan Stanley and Cowen &amp; Co both reiterated strong buy ratings on United Technologies today, a day after the company hosted an upbeat analyst meeting.</p>
<p>Neither firm's analyst was immediately available to comment on the rating actions.</p>
<p>Shares in United Technologies rose 3-1/8 to 74-1/8. The company declined to comment on the activity in its stock.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
